{"product_id":"uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges","title":"Uwell Yearn Replacement Pod Cartridges","description":"\u003cp\u003eWe asked Uwell to release refillable pod cartridges for the Uwell Yearn pod device because we love it so much and now they're here - a refillable (empty) alternative to the pre-filled pods for the Yearn.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Yearn has been our best selling closed pod device and now it's open to use with all your favourite liquids! Amazing, right?!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs:\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePacket of 4\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.5 ml Capacity with side fill\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1.4 Ohm Resistance Cotton Vertical Coil\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWe strongly suggest the use of 50\/50 PG\/VG salt based e-liquids for this device to ensure your pods don't burn out prematurely.\u003c\/strong\u003e","brand":"Uwell","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41531629076535,"sku":"U Yearn Replace Pod Cartridges","price":1250.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges-4-pack.jpg?v=1741703396","url":"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/uwell-yearn-replacement-pod-cartridges","provider":"[YOUR BRAND]","version":"1.0","type":"link"}




